    "solution": "Dash the shield east, then climb the western pillar and take the upper approach. The stone stops in the upward beam and creates shade with an optional landing. Redirect the upper bolt into the ceiling portal while arriving in that shadow; its distant exit feeds the protected coil. Either land on the stone before the last jump, or use the restored dash to fly straight to the eastern gallery.",
